5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Let's find the werewolf fast! I bet I can spot them right away. Who wants to start?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,"Slow down, Rin. We need a logical approach. Observation is key before we make any hasty accusations.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with George. We should be careful. I don't want to make a mistake.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely to see everyone. Let us be kind to one another while we seek the truth together.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue. Trust is very important. Let's try to listen to each other carefully.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"But if we're too slow, the werewolf will just eat us all! We have to be brave!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,Bravery without a plan is just recklessness. We should watch for inconsistencies in how people speak.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@George, do you think you can tell who is lying? I'm not very good at that.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"We all have our strengths, Daisuke. Your caution is a strength too.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,Exactly. A balance of Rin's energy and George's logic might be our best bet.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,I'm the best at finding things! I'll be the detective!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,Then be a detective who observes. Let's see how everyone reacts tomorrow morning.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll try my best to help... if you tell me what to look for.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,Let us simply be honest with our feelings. The truth usually finds a way to surface.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I'll try to keep the peace. Let's make sure everyone feels heard.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,Okay! I'm ready for tomorrow!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
