31,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Okay, it's Day 1! Who looks suspicious? George is being way too quiet!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,"I am simply thinking, Rin. Your immediate aggression is more noteworthy than my silence.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I don't know... George seems calm, like always. Maybe Rin is just excited?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now. Let's not jump to conclusions. However, we must be mindful of the facts.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,I feel a bit of tension. Let's try to talk through our thoughts instead of pointing fingers.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@George, why are you always acting so ""logical""? It feels like you're hiding something!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"Logic is not a mask, it is a tool. Perhaps you are trying to deflect attention from yourself?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Rin, maybe you should calm down a little? You're making me nervous.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I have a feeling that we should look closely at those who try to steer the conversation too sharply.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, do you have a specific person in mind? You sound very certain.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,"See! Shizue is onto something! It's George, isn't it? He's the werewolf!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,That is a baseless accusation. I have provided nothing but steady guidance.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't want to vote for George if he's innocent. But Rin is so sure...,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is a heavy burden to decide, but I believe George is the one we are looking for.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"If Shizue, who is always so gentle, is suspicious, we should take it seriously.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,I knew it! Let's vote George out right now!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,You are all being swayed by emotion and a few vague hints. This is illogical.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll trust Shizue and Midori. I'm sorry, George.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Midori"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am sorry it had to be this way, George.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. The evidence of behavior points toward George.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
